@Trame_HostAddress = http://localhost:5052

### Discovery – Alle verfügbaren Controller/Methoden abrufen
GET {{Trame_HostAddress}}/api/trame/discovery
Accept: application/json

### Single Call – GetAdresse (TestService)
POST {{Trame_HostAddress}}/api/trame/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "controller": "TestService",
  "method": "GetAdresse",
  "params": [
    { "parameterName": "id", "data": 1 },
    { "parameterName": "greet", "data": "Hallo" }
  ],
  "id": "TestService.GetAdresse"
}

### Single Call – GetAllCustomers (Customer)
POST {{Trame_HostAddress}}/api/trame/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "controller": "Customer",
  "method": "GetAllCustomers",
  "params": [],
  "id": "Customer.GetAllCustomers"
}

### Single Call – AddCustomer (Customer)
POST {{Trame_HostAddress}}/api/trame/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "controller": "Customer",
  "method": "AddCustomer",
  "params": [
    { "parameterName": "name", "data": "Max Mustermann" }
  ],
  "id": "Customer.AddCustomer"
}

### Multi Call – Serial mit Dependency-Chaining
POST {{Trame_HostAddress}}/api/trame/json/multi
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requests": [
    {
      "controller": "Customer",
      "method": "AddCustomer",
      "params": [
        { "parameterName": "name", "data": "Alice" }
      ],
      "id": "createAlice",
      "dependencyMapping": {
        "createAliceId": "$"
      }
    },
    {
      "controller": "Customer",
      "method": "GetCustomerById",
      "params": [
        { "parameterName": "id", "data": "@createAliceId" }
      ],
      "id": "getAlice"
    }
  ],
  "mode": 1
}

###
